Hi Casper,

Spot Type File contains information which of spots are: positive
controls,
negative controls, print controls, blanks, cDNAs or oligos i.e. probes
of interest, etc.

Spots' status should be described in file supplied by arrays'
manufacturer.

Best wishes,
Maciej

